("001","Żerań (OP-Żerań, Z1)","PROX_SCAN","C","The hub of the survivor community, on the Vistula at the north of the corridor.","Power, radio and water access are routed from here. Class D ground. A hand-built radio stands here, with cable run up the stairwell toward the chimney. The houseboat where Diana lived is moored at Żerań."),
