("003","Brodno (OP-Brodno, SZ)","PROX_SCAN","","The old hospital, used by the survivors as their medical post.","Szpital Brodno. Medical, defensible, multiple buildings. Class D ground. Catalina Chmielewska treats patients with documented exposure here."),
